  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>My <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>heart <chord name="Dm/A"/>can <chord name="Bb"/>sing when I pause <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>to <chord name="Bb"/>remember,<br/>
      <chord name="Adim"/>A heartache <chord name="F"/>here is but <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>a <chord name="Dm/A"/>stepping stone.<br/>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>Along a <chord name="Bb"/>trail, that&#x27;s winding <chord name="Adim"/>always <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>upward,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>This <chord name="F7/Eb"/>troubled <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>world, <chord name="Bb"/>is not my final <chord name="F"/>home.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="c1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb/D"/>But until then, <chord name="Adim"/>my <chord name="Dm/A"/>heart will <chord name="Bb"/>go <chord name="F7/A"/>on <chord name="Bb"/>singing,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Until <chord name="Adim"/>then, with joy I&#x27;ll <chord name="Gm"/>carry <chord name="Adim"/>on,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Until the <chord name="Cm"/>day <chord name="Bm"/>my <chord name="B"/>eyes <chord name="Cm"/>behold <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>the <chord name="Gm"/>city,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Until <chord name="Dm/A"/>the day <chord name="Adim"/>God calls <chord name="Bb"/>me home.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>The <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>things <chord name="Dm/A"/>of <chord name="Bb"/>earth will dim and <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>loose <chord name="Bb"/>there <chord name="Dm/A"/>value,<br/>
      <chord name="Adim"/>If we recall <chord name="F"/>they&#x27;re borrowed <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>for <chord name="Dm/A"/>awhile;<br/>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>And <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>things <chord name="Dm/A"/>of <chord name="Bb"/>earth that cause the <chord name="Adim"/>heart <chord name="Bb"/>to <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>tremble,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>Remember there, <chord name="Bb"/>will only bring <chord name="Adim"/>a <chord name="F"/>smile.
      </lines>
